@startuml sm-online-payment
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #1D4ED8
  FontColor #0F172A
}
title State Machine — OnlinePayment / VNPay (MF-05)
left to right direction
[*] --> PENDING : Client clicks Pay with VNPay
PENDING --> PENDING : Reused active session
PENDING --> PROCESSING : Signed IPN / Return claims payment
PENDING --> FAILED : Session expired before callback
PROCESSING --> PENDING : Error, claim released for retry
PROCESSING --> SUCCEEDED : Fee recorded as PAID (VNPay ref)
PROCESSING --> NEEDS_REVIEW : Paid at gateway but fee already settled
PROCESSING --> FAILED : VNPay reports cancelled / failed
SUCCEEDED --> [*]
NEEDS_REVIEW --> [*] : Platform Admin resolves
FAILED --> [*]
@enduml
